<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS7.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.7 Defense Baselines ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">APNEAP.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS7.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.7 Defense Baselines ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DP.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS7.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.7 Defense Baselines ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scrubbing.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS7.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.7 Defense Baselines ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Patch</span>.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5 Results ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Patch</span>-Baseline achieves strong privacy-utility tradeoffs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5 Results ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Patch</span>-DP provides maximal privacy at varied utility costs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5 Results ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Be careful of precision increases.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5 Results ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Comparison to existing defenses.</span></a></li>
