<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5 Results ‣ Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Privacy budget considerations.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Patch: Mitigating PII Leakage in Language Models with Privacy-Aware Targeted Circuit PatcHing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Analysis of PII Leakage Circuits</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
