<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Examples from the European Court of Human Rights (ECHR) dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chalkidis et al., 2019</a>)</cite>, illustrating PII types used in our original and corrupted prompts. <span id="S3.T1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6FF;">Purple</span> represents a original token, <span id="S3.T1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFE6E6;">red</span> represents a corrupted token.</figcaption>
